{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重慶\n佛學社印行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊六卷九期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊一卷五期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊二卷七期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十二卷五期至九期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見二十五年七月佛教日\n報"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊四卷十一期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見覺社叢書第四期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊五卷六卷各期"}
{"id": null, "n": "0441001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0441001", "type": "orig", "text": "海刊原題「攝大乘論講錄」，今依法相唯識學改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0690001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0690001", "type": "orig", "text": "海刊原題，五期作「講要」，六期作「講錄」，七期起又作「講義」；今依法相唯識學本，作講要。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0694002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0694002", "type": "orig", "text": "三十論本文，頌前有長行發起：此編於頌前長行，或直錄原文，或以語體文出之，頗不一致，故今唯以頌文為本文而以長行等入講要中。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0801001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0801001", "type": "orig", "text": "此下原附有「五陰與五蘊之研究」一篇，今刪。編入「義繹中」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640a0301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0640a0301", "type": "add", "text": "几【CB】，儿【太虛】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0871a0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0871a0601", "type": "add", "text": "斂【CB】，歛【太虛】"}
